      "writtenOn": "2023-11-03T14:15:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is part of the goal with using this name to align w/ the current format of memory dumping for ganesh? If so, would it make more sense for this base resource name to be defined in the trace memory dump file itself as opposed to separately by ganesh\u0027s and graphite\u0027s resource files? Just a consideration",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 112,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 112,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "22583df30720996e0c99811939a65c1c1188afe8",
